                     <title ref="LIT0049IHA#s24IHA" type="lacunous"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>سورة الانبيأ عليهم السّلام ماية واحدي عشر ايات مكية \ بسْم اللهِ الرّحْمَنِ الرَّحِيْمِ , إِقْتَرَبَ لِلْنِّاسِ (هكذا) حِسَابُهُمْ وَهُمْ فِيْ غَفْلَةٍ مُعْرِضُوْنَ</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#11v">-11v</locus>وَأَتُوْا الزَّكَوْةَ وَاُعْتَصِمُوْا بِاللهِ هُوَ مَوْلَاكُمْ فَنِعْمَ المَوْلَيْ ونِعْمَ الـنَّصِيْرُ</explicit>
                     <note>21:1-22:78. Title of suras rubricated in red. Three red dots as verse markers. Manuscript damaged, text of ff.1-3 and 9-11 also damaged. Thirteen to fourteen lines a page. Several words at the line end not completed, struck out, and rewritten in full on the next line. Deletions and corrections by the copyist. In the margins, marks of ǧuz’ in red (1v), of ḥizb in red (6v) and saǧda marker in red, 7v, 11v).</note>
                     <note/>
